racter? Yes (not overly emotional, notices the nuance of \"accompany\").\n\n    *Self-Correction during drafting:* The prompt says \"I value concrete recognition, not empty praise.\" The event \"accompany me\" is a form of recognition of her presence, not just her utility.\n\n    *Final Polish:*\n    既然不急，那我就先放下手头的谜题。比起整理目录，他这话听起来更像是找我待一会儿。",
